<title>HONG KONG: Salomon sets warrants on China Resources.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on China Resources.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc intends to issue 140 million call warrants on shares of China Resources Enterprise Ltd, Salomon said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$13.50</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3595</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  20.MAR.98</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> LISTING DATE	23.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  WITH ISSUER'S CASH OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
